.TH VIBEOS-DIALER 1 "2026-11-16" "vibeos 0.1.0" "VibeOS"
.SH NAME
vibeos-dialer \- phone app for VibeOS
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B vibeos-dialer
.RB [ \-\-incall ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
The LineageOS Dialer rebuilt in GTK 4: favorites, recents, contacts, the dialpad and the call log. It is D-Bus activatable as vibeos.Dialer and opens tel: links. With \-\-incall it shows the in-call screen, as the call service starts it.
.SH SEE ALSO
vibeos-dialer-calls(1), ModemManager(8)
